  "meta": {
    "name": "quote_documents",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "The quote's documents (196, plan F-Word-output, DECISIONS 196, jav/quote_document.py): the built-in Word template of an approved quote in Hungarian and English, and how the quote's language is estimated. language: the request's subject and requested items are scored by code, never by a model: each Hungarian accented letter and each listed Hungarian word counts for Hungarian, each listed English word for English; English wins only with a higher score, so a request with nothing to go by is Hungarian (`default`). A person changes the language on the quote's page. quote: the built-in template's texts per language (document vocabulary: the Hungarian ones stay Hungarian), its table's columns in order with their widths, the page (A4), the page number's text around it, and the file name's prefix; a line of the heading whose value is empty is left out. labels: the Hungarian labels of the output's values and of its one column the built-in table does not show (the settings page's marker list). The numbers are written by code (jav/outputs/docx.py).",
    "changelog": [
      {"version": "1.0.0", "date": "2026-10-22", "note": "196 (plan F-Word-output W2): the built-in quote template in Hungarian and English, the language estimate."}
    ]
  },
